Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}{\i1}{\pos(1921,1829)}你忘了吗？自这份记忆中诞生
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.64,0:00:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}{\i1}{\pos(1921,1829)}我仍再次站起…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.60,0:00:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}{\i1}{\pos(1921,1829)}连这一步也曾挡在我面前吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.93,0:00:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}现在我明白了，我明白了…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.42,0:00:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}即使看不见这只手所能触及的彼方
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.13,0:01:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}漫无意义地走下去，我究竟在追寻什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.70,0:01:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}即使受伤，即使失去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.85,0:01:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}即使察觉一切毫无意义
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.50,0:01:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}时光流逝，而我们终将朽去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.20,0:01:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}即使一切终将结束…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.88,0:01:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}即便如此，仍押上一切
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.94,0:01:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}即使目的地已不复存在
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.61,0:01:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}只要一直朝那更远的彼方前进
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.35,0:01:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}我们一定会…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.73,0:01:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}你现在要去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.22,0:01:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}IMMORTAL，我仍记得…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.62,0:01:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}我们活着，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.50,0:01:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}没有什么正在开始
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.86,0:01:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}此刻也没有什么正在结束
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.08,0:01:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}曾在这只手中的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.52,0:01:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}那份意志，那个答案
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.47,0:01:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}为了与不灭的灯火一同前行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.46,0:01:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}IMMORTAL，我仍记得，所以我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.00,0:01:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}我们活着，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.84,0:02:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}没有什么正在开始
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.22,0:02:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}此刻也没有什么正在结束
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.06,0:02:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}你终将离去，把它留下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.50,0:02:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}没有什么在等待，你只管继续前行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.03,0:02:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}反正没有人知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.79,0:02:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}每一次，一切都会留下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.10,0:02:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}没有什么正在开始
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.37,0:02:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}此刻也没有什么正在结束
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.39,0:02:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}终有一天会结束这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.51,0:02:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}你接受了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.58,0:02:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}即便如此，每当向前迈进
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.04,0:02:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}却变得更远、更远
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.30,0:02:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}{\i1}{\pos(1921,1829)}—越是追寻能使我完整之物\N—从来没有什么能真正成为你的所得
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.60,0:02:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}{\i1}{\pos(1921,1829)}—那些从指间滑落的事物反而不断满溢\N—你身后，是那些骄傲倒下的人们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.16,0:02:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}{\i1}{\pos(1921,1829)}—即便如此，仍要向前\N—只要这双腿还能动
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.97,0:02:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}{\i1}{\pos(1921,1829)}—因为那并不是停下的理由\N—将你的意志一路带到底
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.83,0:02:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.24,0:03:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}{\i1}{\pos(1921,1829)}IMMORTAL，我仍记得…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.79,0:03:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}{\i1}{\pos(1921,1829)}留在这掌心中的遗志
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.20,0:03:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}直到现在，也不让它熄灭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.55,0:03:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}一直紧紧握住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.44,0:03:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}直到能触碰到那只手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.89,0:03:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}我都会继续前进
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.23,0:03:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(100,100)}IMMORTAL，我仍记得，所以我明白
